  "briefing": {
    "headline": "Corn bounces 2¾¢ to $4.51½ after four lower closes",
    "lead": "Dec corn is at $4.51½ overnight, up 2¾ cents from Tuesday's $4.48¾ settle. That ends a run of lower closes. Soybeans are at $12.33¼ overnight, up 4 cents, after two lower closes. A fast harvest has been the weight on grain, and one overnight bounce does not change that.",
